@base = http://localhost:8290

### Account number not 10 digits (expect 400 INVALID_ACCOUNT_NUMBER)
GET {{base}}/accounts/12ab/balance

### Customer id not numeric (expect 400 INVALID_CUSTOMER_ID)
GET {{base}}/customers/abc

### Body is not valid JSON (expect 400 INVALID_REQUEST, not 500)
POST {{base}}/loans/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "1", "monthlyIncome": 1200

### Schema violation: negative income, missing tenure (expect 400 INVALID_REQUEST)
POST {{base}}/loans/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "1", "monthlyIncome": -5, "requestedAmount": 3000}

### Unknown field (expect 400: additionalProperties is false)
POST {{base}}/loans/eligibility
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "1", "monthlyIncome": 1000, "requestedAmount": 3000, "tenureMonths": 12, "salary": 5}

### Wrong content type (expect 415 UNSUPPORTED_MEDIA_TYPE)
POST {{base}}/loans/eligibility
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
